  "layoutMapUrl": null,
  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 24 closes Lincoln Ridge at 450 feet — the longest par 3 on the card and the perfect final exam for 24 holes of varied, hilly golf. A clean drive, a careful approach, and you've earned a par on the course's biggest test. It's the finish that makes the walk back to the lot feel like a victory lap.",
